  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/lwvgt84cle4.png\" alt=\"BisectHosting 宣傳條幅\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">✨ 需要伺服器嗎？選擇 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fp%252fBigChadGuys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></strong>！ ✨</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>身為模組包開發者，我用過許多伺服器提供商，但 Bisect 的伺服器在品質與支援方面表現突出。在這個充斥黑暗手法、難以聯繫的客服以及退款遭拒的行業裡，Bisect 採取不同的做法。他們避開這些陷阱，並優先考慮您的滿意度。</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">💞 使用優惠碼 <strong>BIGCHADGUYS</strong> 可享首月 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣！💞</p><p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner1.png\" alt=\"概覽\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">✨ 想像一下《星露谷物语》結合《寶可夢》！ ✨ <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbigchadguys.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BigChadGuys</a> Plus</strong> 是一款舒適溫馨的 Cobblemon 冒險，靈感來自與寶可夢共度的日常生活。進入一個美麗的世界。探索數百種裝飾品，從打字機到電視機再到馬桶。和朋友們開飛機、火車和汽車競速。透過大量農耕與烹飪模組擴展您的食譜。在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fselling-bin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Selling Bin</a></strong> 中賣出您的作物與生物掉落物！並在 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaily-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daily Shop</a></strong> 中購買稀有獨特物品！<strong>BCG+</strong> 遵循如原版《Minecraft》的進度系統，在熟悉的基礎上加入令人興奮的新變化。</p><p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner2.png\" alt=\"特色\"></p><p>✨ <strong>推薦記憶體</strong>：<strong>6GB</strong> 至 <strong>8GB</strong> 以獲得極致效能！</p><p>✨ <strong>美麗世界生成</strong>：由 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fterralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></strong> 驅動。</p><p>✨ <strong>內建光影</strong>：透過 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary</a></strong> 體驗絕美視覺效果。</p><p>✨ <strong>引人入勝的任務</strong>：投入我們全面的任務系統，每個轉折點都充滿挑戰！</p><p>✨ <strong>單人/多人經濟系統</strong>：透過我們的客製化 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaily-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daily Shop</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fselling-bin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Selling Bin</a></strong>，體驗獨特的經濟模式。釋放您內心的資本家——建造大型農場，為您無止境收集小玩意與飾品的目標提供資金。</p><p>✨ <strong>飛機、火車與汽車</strong>：探索豐富的載具收藏，以時尚方式旅行！再也不用擔心遲到——而且，現在您有了完美的理由，建造那個您一直想要的停車場。</p><p>✨ <strong>大量新裝飾</strong>：潛入裝飾品的寶庫！數百種選擇讓您不斷驚喜，想著：<em>不會吧，連這個也有？！</em></p><p>✨ <strong>農耕與烹飪新風貌</strong>：準備好探索更廣闊的烹飪冒險世界！豐富的食材讓可能性無窮無盡——從製作壽司卷到烘焙披薩，甚至做一份培根三明治。您永遠不會對烹飪新菜感到厭倦！</p><p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner4.png\" alt=\"影片\"></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zI8exTF2BWU?si=WZGrt7raBliqzZM0\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wLPe06mfa2o?si=d4BoYRMJkv6gIEu7\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/d4s0Jv7bzJ4?si=6SCOEBNS9d7N5E69\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><p><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/m13y55879fe.png\" alt=\"致謝\"></p><p><strong>Allone</strong> (allone_the_duck)，《Allone's Additions》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fnotsocobblemon-allones-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/notsocobblemon-allones-additions</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>ASHISK</strong> (ashisk)，《Ashimons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fashimons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/ashimons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>BeeZy</strong> (beezymc)，《LackingMons》的共同創作者之一</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/lackingmons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>BifeSalgado</strong> (BifeSalgado)，《OdysseyMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fodysseymons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/odysseymons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Bwavii</strong> (bwavi)，《WaviMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwavimons-(cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/wavimons-(cobblemon</a>)</li>\n</ul><p><strong>El Pigeon</strong> (elpigeon)，《Pigeon's PokePack》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fpigeons-poke-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/pigeons-poke-pack</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Genotype</strong> (genotypexd)，《GenoMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgenomons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/genomons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>iMystxc</strong> (iMystxc)，《MysticMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmysticmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/mysticmons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>IZetyXX</strong> (izetyxx)，《LackingMons》的共同創作者之一</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flackingmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/lackingmons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Kale</strong> (kylbrez)，《Kale's Collection》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fkales-cobblemon-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/kales-cobblemon-collection</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>LegenTM</strong> (legentm)，《HiddenMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fhiddenmons-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/hiddenmons-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>NetImmerse</strong> (netimmerse)，《The Jewel Pokemon》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fthe-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/the-jewel-pokmon-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Raspix</strong> (raspix)，《CobbleCats》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcobble-cats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/cobble-cats</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>RedRibbon</strong> (redriibbon)，《MissingMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmissingmons-cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/missingmons-cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Salt</strong> (saltdan)，《SaltMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsaltmons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/saltmons</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>YaBoiBruno</strong> (Bruno22)，《MoreMons》的創作者</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmoremons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/moremons</a></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B5YQsgSZbR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://us-east-1.tixte.net/uploads/joe.with-your.mom/BH_BCG_banner3.png\" alt=\"加入Discord！\"></a></p>",
